{"version": 1, "slug": "tistory-15", "visibility": "public", "title": "[DreamHack] - structure-based carving", "content": "<div class=\"tistory-content\">\n<p><figure class=\"imageblock alignCenter\">\n<span>\n<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"./content/media/3c32c7e01832c2971f3ea1e9594724cb0e783e05bc38e91b9f09bcce9818f5a6.png\"/>\n</span>\n<figcaption>드림핵 structure-based carving 문제</figcaption>\n</figure></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><figure class=\"imageblock alignCenter\">\n<span>\n<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"./content/media/fd0ec83b5c491e22ac69fc175ffe3f83c25c671bb799c42d80be600bed94a81c.png\"/>\n</span>\n<figcaption>다운로드 받은 파일</figcaption>\n</figure></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><figure class=\"imageblock alignCenter\">\n<span>\n<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"./content/media/6cca14eb5e55148b0829e966a0a1ce56b18113d730ea011c646a42000951634a.png\"/>\n</span>\n<figcaption></figcaption>\n</figure></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>파일 carving_target.bin을 HxD로 열어보았다</p>\n<p>암호에서 zip안에 어딘가에 있다고 했음 -&gt;  50 4B <span>03 04 00 08, <span>50 4B 03 04 00 09 검색</span></span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><figure class=\"imageblock alignCenter\">\n<span>\n<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"./content/media/6d1ea8d1ee9b7061cfe39ba52100bc167e63b659c4f84d16858da1795edc861e.png\"/>\n</span>\n<figcaption>50 4B  03 04 00 08 검색</figcaption>\n</figure></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><figure class=\"imageblock alignCenter\">\n<span>\n<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"./content/media/7cb46cfad442ad5fdb33636ea2d5040bd18449dd3cfe1ef38dbfc18243ec5da1.png\"/>\n</span>\n<figcaption>50 4B 03 04 00 09 검색</figcaption>\n</figure></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>09 근처 먼저 찾아보면</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><figure class=\"imageblock alignCenter\">\n<span>\n<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"./content/media/e3d6ca105881170a49546bb49229bbddf5f800c3d404dda476374b8cd2a47014.png\"/>\n</span>\n<figcaption></figcaption>\n</figure></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>그 다음 PK(Zip파일) 전에 20240421)213802.pngzip의 password가 나와있다.</p>\n<p>다음 pk전까지 자른 뒤 zip파일을 만들어보았다.</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><figure class=\"imageblock alignCenter\">\n<span>\n<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"./content/media/260cd7ff71ef9afff7fb3464a580f466bfef5f1f8f4eadd1829e73b57d71d1d8.png\"/>\n</span>\n<figcaption></figcaption>\n</figure></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><figure class=\"imageblock alignCenter\">\n<span>\n<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"./content/media/cff3eb4ef484d16b9ed8e1d096ee0bf0175f4b5782fc313fe5d9c9515c639c78.png\"/>\n</span>\n<figcaption></figcaption>\n</figure></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>만든 파일의 압축을 풀어보면</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><figure class=\"imageblock alignCenter\">\n<span>\n<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"./content/media/e019e078839a4ea0dfae26c2b1f123a590fd45bfe8fafb255b385bada5a3e5c3.png\"/>\n</span>\n<figcaption></figcaption>\n</figure></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>png가 나오게 되고, 비밀번호는 아까 찾은걸 넣어보면</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><figure class=\"imageblock alignCenter\">\n<span>\n<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"./content/media/0b1202b73526991b1107db98f3fde5363c97440ab510df73379ea078fbf4081c.png\"/>\n</span>\n<figcaption></figcaption>\n</figure></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>Flag 찾기 완료</p>\n</div>", "assets": ["0b1202b73526991b1107db98f3fde5363c97440ab510df73379ea078fbf4081c.png", "260cd7ff71ef9afff7fb3464a580f466bfef5f1f8f4eadd1829e73b57d71d1d8.png", "3c32c7e01832c2971f3ea1e9594724cb0e783e05bc38e91b9f09bcce9818f5a6.png", "6cca14eb5e55148b0829e966a0a1ce56b18113d730ea011c646a42000951634a.png", "6d1ea8d1ee9b7061cfe39ba52100bc167e63b659c4f84d16858da1795edc861e.png", "7cb46cfad442ad5fdb33636ea2d5040bd18449dd3cfe1ef38dbfc18243ec5da1.png", "cff3eb4ef484d16b9ed8e1d096ee0bf0175f4b5782fc313fe5d9c9515c639c78.png", "e019e078839a4ea0dfae26c2b1f123a590fd45bfe8fafb255b385bada5a3e5c3.png", "e3d6ca105881170a49546bb49229bbddf5f800c3d404dda476374b8cd2a47014.png", "fd0ec83b5c491e22ac69fc175ffe3f83c25c671bb799c42d80be600bed94a81c.png"]}